rator captures linguistic nuances, regional accents, and cultural undertones.",feature2Title:"Library of SQ Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide range of English accents to find the one that best suits your needs. We offer a variety of accents and tones, so you can find the perfect voice."},{name:"Hindi",flag:"IN",language:"Hindi",audioSrc:"hindi",voice_id:"DSsG1oAnYMSol2389iIi",placeholderText:"एलेवेनलैब्स में आपका स्वागत है! इस पाठ को हिंदी में वाक् परिवर्तन के लिए नीचे दिए गए प्ले बटन पर क्लिक करें। अपना खुद का पाठ जोड़ें या ड्रॉपडाउन मेनू का उपयोग करके आवाज को अनुकूलित करें। वॉइस क्लोनिंग, डबिंग, और आवाज बदलने जैसी उन्नत सुविधाओं को अनलॉक करने के लिए मुफ्त में साइन अप करें।",howToDescription:"Create engaging voiceovers with our Hindi text to speech. Known for its unique accent and colloquial charm, our Hindi voice generator is perfect for giving your content a down-to-earth and friendly tone. Here’s how to get started:",feature1Title:"Authentic Hindi Accents",feature1Description:"Our AI-powered Hindi voice generator is the most advanced of its kind. It uses deep learning to generate speech that's not only clear but emotionally resonant. Beyond mere translation, our Hindi generator captures linguistic nuances, regional accents, and cultural undertones.",feature2Title:"Library of SQ Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide range of Hindi accents to find the one that best suits your needs. We offer a variety of accents and tones, so you can find the perfect voice."},{name:"Portuguese",flag:"PT",language:"Portuguese",audioSrc:"portuguese",voice_id:"NGS0ZsC7j4t4dCWbPdgO",placeholderText:"Bem-vindo ao Elevenlabs! Clique no botão de reprodução abaixo para converter este texto em voz em português. Adicione seu próprio texto ou personalize a voz usando o menu suspenso. Inscreva-se gratuitamente para desbloquear recursos avançados como clonagem de voz, dublagem e mudança de voz.",howToDescription:"Revitalize your projects with our Portuguese text to speech. Our AI-driven technology offers a natural and authentic Portuguese accent, ideal for infusing your content with a warm and engaging tone. Here's how to get started:",feature1Title:"Realistic Portuguese Dialects",feature1Description:"Our AI-powered Portuguese voice generator is top-notch, using deep learning to produce speech that's clear, engaging, and culturally relevant. It captures the essence of the Portuguese language, including regional dialects and nuances.",feature2Title:"Diverse Range of Voices",feature2Description:"With a broad selection of accents and tones, our Portuguese TTS lets you find the perfect voice for your needs. Our collection ensures versatility and quality for various applications."},{name:"Chinese",flag:"CN",language:"Chinese",audioSrc:"chinese",placeholderText:"欢迎来到Elevenlabs！点击下面的播放按钮，将这段文字转换为中文语音。您可以添加自己的文本或通过下拉菜单自定义语音。免费注册即可解锁高级功能，如声音克隆、配音和变声。",howToDescription:"Elevate your content with our Chinese text to speech. Utilizing advanced AI, our Chinese TTS captures the unique essence and subtleties of the language, perfect for making your content resonate with authenticity. Getting started is easy:",feature1Title:"Rich Chinese Linguistic Detail",feature1Description:"Our Chinese voice generator, powered by AI, provides clear, emotionally resonant speech. It goes beyond basic translation, embracing the intricacies of regional accents and cultural tones.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Library",feature2Description:"Select from a wide array of Chinese accents to suit your specific requirements. Our library includes various tones and styles, offering the ideal voice for every project."},{name:"Spanish",flag:"ES",language:"Spanish",audioSrc:"spanish",voice_id:"LlsiGQPTj7Tt7gsEPZl0",placeholderText:"¡Bienvenido a Elevenlabs! Haz clic en el botón de reproducción a continuación para convertir este texto en voz en español. Añade tu propio texto o personaliza la voz utilizando el menú desplegable. Regístrate gratis para desbloquear funciones avanzadas como clonación de voz, doblaje y cambio de voz.",howToDescription:"Add a vibrant touch to your content with our Spanish text to speech. Our Spanish TTS, powered by AI, delivers an engaging and authentic linguistic experience, perfect for a wide range of applications. Here's how to begin:",feature1Title:"Dynamic Spanish Speech",feature1Description:"Leverage the power of our advanced AI for Spanish speech that’s clear and culturally resonant. Our TTS captures the energy and nuances of Spanish dialects, providing a lifelike experience.",feature2Title:"Wide Selection of Voices",feature2Description:"Explore our extensive range of Spanish voices to find the perfect match for your project. Our collection caters to diverse needs, ensuring the right tone and accent for every scenario."},{name:"Spanish Castilian Accent",flag:"ES",language:"Spanish",audioSrc:"spanish-castilian-accent",voice_id:"vaiZqXP6k5SRp3MKtOoJ",placeholderText:"¡Bienvenido a Elevenlabs! Haz clic en el botón de reproducción a continuación para convertir este texto en voz en español. Añade tu propio texto o personaliza la voz utilizando el menú desplegable. Regístrate gratis para desbloquear funciones avanzadas como clonación de voz, doblaje y cambio de voz.",howToDescription:"Add a vibrant touch to your content with our Spanish Castilian Accent text to speech. Our Spanish Castilian Accent TTS, powered by AI, delivers an engaging and authentic linguistic experience, perfect for a wide range of applications. Here's how to begin:",feature1Title:"Dynamic Spanish Castilian Accent Speech",feature1Description:"Leverage the power of our advanced AI for Spanish Castilian Accent speech that’s clear and culturally resonant. Our TTS captures the energy and nuances of Spanish dialects, providing a lifelike experience.",feature2Title:"Wide Selection of Voices",feature2Description:"Explore our extensive range of Spanish voices to find the perfect match for your project. Our collection caters to diverse needs, ensuring the right tone and accent for every scenario."},{name:"French",flag:"FR",language:"French",audioSrc:"french",placeholderText:"Bienvenue sur Elevenlabs ! Cliquez sur le bouton de lecture ci-dessous pour convertir ce texte en parole en français. Ajoutez votre propre texte ou personnalisez la voix à l'aide du menu déroulant. Inscrivez-vous gratuitement pour débloquer des fonctionnalités avancées telles que le clonage de voix, le doublage et la modification de la voix.",howToDescription:"Transform your projects with our French text to speech. Our French TTS, driven by AI, offers a rich and authentic accent, ideal for adding a touch of elegance and charm to your content. Here’s how to use it:",feature1Title:"Sophisticated French Eloquence",feature1Description:"Our French voice generator, utilizing AI technology, provides clear, emotionally engaging speech. It captures the elegance and nuances of the French language, including regional accents and expressions.",feature2Title:"Broad Spectrum of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from our vast collection of French voices, each with its unique accent and tone. Our range ensures that you find the ideal voice for narrating, voiceovers, and other applications."},{name:"French Swiss Accent",flag:"CH",language:"French",audioSrc:"french-swiss-accent",voice_id:"XeVbkJn7LVS2lH3RXcQJ",placeholderText:"Bienvenue sur Elevenlabs ! Cliquez sur le bouton de lecture ci-dessous pour convertir ce texte en parole en français. Ajoutez votre propre texte ou personnalisez la voix à l'aide du menu déroulant. Inscrivez-vous gratuitement pour débloquer des fonctionnalités avancées telles que le clonage de voix, le doublage et la modification de la voix.",howToDescription:"Transform your projects with our French text to speech. Our French TTS, driven by AI, offers a rich and authentic accent, ideal for adding a touch of elegance and charm to your content. Here’s how to use it:",feature1Title:"Sophisticated French Eloquence",feature1Description:"Our French voice generator, utilizing AI technology, provides clear, emotionally engaging speech. It captures the elegance and nuances of the French language, including regional accents and expressions.",feature2Title:"Broad Spectrum of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from our vast collection of French voices, each with its unique accent and tone. Our range ensures that you find the ideal voice for narrating, voiceovers, and other applications."},{name:"German",flag:"DE",language:"German",audioSrc:"german",voice_id:"lx8LAX2EUAKftVz0Dk5z",placeholderText:"Klicken Sie unten auf die Wiedergabetaste, um diesen Text in deutscher Sprache in Sprache zu konvertieren. Fügen Sie Ihren eigenen Text hinzu oder passen Sie die Stimme über das Dropdown-Menü an. Melden Sie sich kostenlos an, um erweiterte Funktionen wie Sprachklonung, Synchronisierung und Stimmveränderung freizuschalten.",howToDescription:"Enhance your content with our German text to speech. Our AI-powered TTS delivers a genuine German accent, perfect for creating content with a trustworthy and authoritative tone. Here's your starting point:",feature1Title:"Authentic German Precision",feature1Description:"Experience the best in AI-driven German speech, offering clarity and emotional depth. Our TTS captures the intricacies of the German language, including its various dialects and cultural nuances.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Options",feature2Description:"Our German TTS offers a wide selection of accents and tones, enabling you to find the perfect voice for your specific needs. Our library caters to a range of applications, ensuring versatility and quality."},{name:"Japanese",flag:"JP",language:"Japanese",audioSrc:"japanese",placeholderText:"Elevenlabsへようこそ！以下の再生ボタンをクリックして、このテキストを日本語の音声に変換してください。ドロップダウンメニューを使用して、自分のテキストを追加したり、声をカスタマイズしたりできます。音声クローニング、吹き替え、声変えなどの高度な機能を無料でアンロックするには、サインアップしてください。",howToDescription:"Bring a unique flair to your content with our Japanese text to speech. Our AI-powered Japanese TTS captures the essence of the language, perfect for engaging and authentic voiceovers. Here’s how to get started:",feature1Title:"True Japanese Elegance",feature1Description:"Our Japanese voice generator is at the forefront of AI technology, offering speech that is clear, nuanced, and culturally rich. It goes beyond mere translation to capture the subtleties of the Japanese language and accents.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Range",feature2Description:"Choose from a broad selection of Japanese voices, each tailored to fit various needs. Our collection ensures that you find the right tone and style for your content, enhancing its impact and appeal."},{name:"Arabic",flag:"AE",language:"Arabic",audioSrc:"arabic",placeholderText:"مرحبًا بك في Elevenlabs! انقر على زر التشغيل أدناه لتحويل هذا النص إلى كلام باللغة العربية. أضف نصك الخاص أو قم بتخصيص الصوت باستخدام قائمة الخيارات. اشترك مجانًا لفتح ميزات متقدمة مثل استنساخ الصوت والدوبلاج وتغيير الصوت.",howToDescription:"Transform your content with our Arabic text to speech. Utilizing advanced AI, our Arabic TTS delivers an authentic and engaging linguistic experience, perfect for creating content that resonates with depth and culture. Here’s how to begin:",feature1Title:"Deep Arabic Linguistic Insights",feature1Description:"Our AI-powered Arabic voice generator is unparalleled, offering speech that’s clear and emotionally resonant. It captures the richness of Arabic dialects and the cultural depth of the language.",feature2Title:"Wide Array of Voices",feature2Description:"Explore our diverse range of Arabic voices to find the perfect match for your project. Our selection includes various tones and styles, ensuring the ideal voice for every type of content."},{name:"Russian",flag:"RU",language:"Russian",audioSrc:"russian",voice_id:"WczBIOau2qV9z7nLeDqq",placeholderText:"Добро пожаловать в Elevenlabs! Нажмите кнопку воспроизведения ниже, чтобы преобразовать этот текст в речь на русском языке. Добавьте свой собственный текст или настройте голос, используя выпадающее меню. Зарегистрируйтесь бесплатно, чтобы разблокировать продвинутые функции, такие как клонирование голоса, дубляж и изменение голоса.",howToDescription:"Enhance your content with our Russian text to speech. Leveraging AI, our Russian TTS delivers a truly authentic accent, perfect for adding depth and authenticity to your content. Here’s how to start:",feature1Title:"Rich Russian Tone",feature1Description:"Our Russian voice generator, powered by advanced AI, offers clear, culturally resonant speech. It captures the nuances and regional dialects of the Russian language, ensuring a lifelike experience.",feature2Title:"Variety of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide range of Russian voices, each suitable for different content needs. Our collection offers diversity in tone and accent, providing the perfect match for any project."},{name:"Korean",flag:"KR",language:"Korean",audioSrc:"korean",placeholderText:"Elevenlabs에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 아래 재생 버튼을 클릭하여 이 텍스트를 한국어 음성으로 변환하세요. 드롭다운 메뉴를 사용하여 자신의 텍스트를 추가하거나 음성을 사용자 정의할 수 있습니다. 음성 복제, 더빙, 음성 변경과 같은 고급 기능을 잠금 해제하려면 무료로 가입하세요.",howToDescription:"Bring a unique touch to your content with our Korean text to speech. Our AI-driven TTS captures the essence of Korean, perfect for creating engaging and authentic voiceovers. Here’s how to get started:",feature1Title:"Authentic Korean Speech",feature1Description:"Our AI-powered Korean voice generator provides clear, emotionally resonant speech. It goes beyond basic translation, embracing the intricacies and cultural depth of the Korean language.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Library",feature2Description:"Select from a variety of Korean voices, each with its unique style. Our range ensures the perfect voice for your content, enhancing its appeal and impact."},{name:"Indonesian",flag:"ID",language:"Indonesian",audioSrc:"indonesian",placeholderText:"Selamat datang di Elevenlabs! Klik tombol putar di bawah ini untuk mengonversi teks ini menjadi suara dalam bahasa Indonesia. Tambahkan teks Anda sendiri atau sesuaikan suara menggunakan menu dropdown. Daftar gratis untuk membuka fitur canggih seperti kloning suara, dubbing, dan perubahan suara.",howToDescription:"Transform your projects with our Indonesian text to speech. Utilizing AI technology, our Indonesian TTS delivers a natural and engaging accent, perfect for creating local and relatable content. Here’s how to use it:",feature1Title:"Natural Indonesian Tone",feature1Description:"Our Indonesian voice generator, leveraging AI, offers speech that is clear and culturally rich. It captures the unique nuances and accents of the Indonesian language, providing an authentic experience.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Options",feature2Description:"Explore our extensive range of Indonesian voices to find the perfect fit for your project. Our collection includes various tones and styles, catering to a wide range of applications."},{name:"Italian",flag:"IT",language:"Italian",audioSrc:"italian",voice_id:"zcAOhNBS3c14rBihAFp1",placeholderText:"Benvenuto su Elevenlabs! Fai clic sul pulsante di riproduzione qui sotto per convertire questo testo in voce in italiano. Aggiungi il tuo testo o personalizza la voce utilizzando il menu a discesa. Registrati gratuitamente per sbloccare funzionalità avanzate come la clonazione vocale, il doppiaggio e il cambiamento di voce.",howToDescription:"Elevate your content with our Italian text to speech. Our AI-powered Italian TTS offers an authentic and melodious accent, ideal for giving your content a charming and engaging tone. Here's how to get started:",feature1Title:"Melodic Italian Speech",feature1Description:"Our Italian voice generator, powered by AI, provides clear and emotionally resonant speech. It captures the musicality and nuances of the Italian language, including regional dialects.",feature2Title:"Wide Selection of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from our diverse range of Italian voices, each perfect for different content needs. Our collection ensures the ideal voice for narration, voiceovers, and other applications."},{name:"Dutch",flag:"NL",language:"Dutch",audioSrc:"dutch",placeholderText:"Welkom bij Elevenlabs! Klik op de afspeelknop hieronder om deze tekst in het Nederlands om te zetten in spraak. Voeg uw eigen tekst toe of pas de stem aan met behulp van het dropdownmenu. Meld u gratis aan om geavanceerde functies zoals stemklonen, nasynchronisatie en stemverandering te ontgrendelen.",howToDescription:"Add a distinctive flair to your content with our Dutch text to speech. Our AI-driven Dutch TTS captures the unique character of the language, perfect for creating engaging and authentic voiceovers. Here’s how to begin:",feature1Title:"Authentic Dutch Experience",feature1Description:"Our AI-powered Dutch voice generator offers clear, culturally resonant speech. It goes beyond mere translation to embrace the subtleties and regional accents of the Dutch language.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Range",feature2Description:"Explore our wide selection of Dutch voices, each tailored to fit various needs. Our collection ensures that you find the right tone and style for your content, enhancing its impact and appeal."},{name:"Turkish",flag:"TR",language:"Turkish",audioSrc:"turkish",placeholderText:"Elevenlabs'a hoş geldiniz! Bu metni Türkçe'ye seslendirmek için aşağıdaki oynatma düğmesine tıklayın. Kendi metninizi ekleyin veya açılır menüyü kullanarak sesi özelleştirin. Ses klonlama, dublaj ve ses değiştirme gibi gelişmiş özelliklerin kilidini açmak için ücretsiz kaydolun.",howToDescription:"Revitalize your projects with our Turkish text to speech. Utilizing advanced AI, our Turkish TTS delivers an authentic and engaging linguistic experience, perfect for creating content that resonates with depth and culture. Here’s how to start:",feature1Title:"Deep Turkish Linguistic Insights",feature1Description:"Our AI-powered Turkish voice generator is unparalleled, offering speech that’s clear and emotionally resonant. It captures the richness of Turkish dialects and the cultural depth of the language.",feature2Title:"Wide Array of Voices",feature2Description:"Our Turkish TTS offers a diverse range of voices to find the perfect match for your project. Our selection includes various tones and styles, ensuring the ideal voice for every type of content."},{name:"Turkish Istanbul Accent",flag:"TR",language:"Turkish",voice_id:"fZEjvS1BvpajAoOmWcEO",audioSrc:"turkish-istanbul-accent",placeholderText:"Elevenlabs'a hoş geldiniz! Bu metni Türkçe'ye seslendirmek için aşağıdaki oynatma düğmesine tıklayın. Kendi metninizi ekleyin veya açılır menüyü kullanarak sesi özelleştirin. Ses klonlama, dublaj ve ses değiştirme gibi gelişmiş özelliklerin kilidini açmak için ücretsiz kaydolun.",howToDescription:"Revitalize your projects with our Turkish Istanbul Accent text to speech. Utilizing advanced AI, our Turkish Istanbul Accent TTS delivers an authentic and engaging linguistic experience, perfect for creating content that resonates with depth and culture. Here’s how to start:",feature1Title:"Deep Turkish Istanbul Linguistic Insights",feature1Description:"Our AI-powered Turkish Istanbul voice generator is unparalleled, offering speech that’s clear and emotionally resonant. It captures the richness of the Turkish Istanbul dialect and the cultural depth of the Turkish language.",feature2Title:"Wide Array of Voices",feature2Description:"Our Turkish TTS offers a diverse range of voices to find the perfect match for your project. Our selection includes various tones and styles, ensuring the ideal voice for every type of content."},{name:"Polish",flag:"PL",language:"Polish",audioSrc:"polish",placeholderText:"Witamy w Elevenlabs! Kliknij poniżej przycisk odtwarzania, aby przekształcić ten tekst na mowę w języku polskim. Dodaj własny tekst lub dostosuj głos za pomocą menu rozwijanego. Zarejestruj się za darmo, aby odblokować zaawansowane funkcje takie jak klonowanie głosu, dubbing i zmiana głosu.",howToDescription:"Enhance your content with our Polish text to speech. Our AI-driven Polish TTS delivers a truly authentic accent, perfect for adding depth and authenticity to your content. Here’s how to get started:",feature1Title:"Rich Polish Tone",feature1Description:"Our Polish voice generator, powered by advanced AI, offers clear, culturally resonant speech. It captures the nuances and regional dialects of the Polish language, ensuring a lifelike experience.",feature2Title:"Variety of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide range of Polish voices, each suitable for different content needs. Our collection offers diversity in tone and accent, providing the perfect match for any project."},{name:"Swedish",flag:"SE",language:"Swedish",audioSrc:"swedish",voice_id:"XB0fDUnXU5powFXDhCwa",placeholderText:"Välkommen till Elevenlabs! Klicka på spelknappen nedan för att omvandla denna text till tal på svenska. Lägg till din egen text eller anpassa rösten med hjälp av rullgardinsmenyn. Registrera dig gratis för att låsa upp avancerade funktioner som röstkloning, dubbning och röstförändring.",howToDescription:"Enhance your projects with our Swedish text to speech. Our AI-driven technology delivers an authentic Swedish accent, perfect for creating a local feel in your content. Here's how to use it:",feature1Title:"Authentic Swedish Accent",feature1Description:"Our Swedish AI voices leverage advanced AI to produce speech that’s both clear and culturally accurate. It not only understands the language but also the subtleties of the Swedish accent and dialects, offering a genuine experience.",feature2Title:"Variety of Voices",feature2Description:"Select from a diverse range of voices to match your specific requirements. Whether you need a voice for narration, voiceovers, or other applications, our Swedish TTS provides an array of options to find the perfect fit for your project."},{name:"Filipino",flag:"PH",language:"Filipino",audioSrc:"filipino",placeholderText:"Maligayang pagdating sa Elevenlabs! I-click ang play button sa ibaba para i-convert ang tekstong ito sa salitang Filipino. Magdagdag ng sarili mong teksto o i-customize ang boses gamit ang dropdown menu. Mag-sign up ng libre para ma-unlock ang advanced na features tulad ng voice cloning, dubbing, at pagbabago ng boses.",howToDescription:"Bring a local touch to your content with our Filipino text to speech. Powered by AI, our Filipino TTS delivers an engaging and culturally relevant voice, perfect for adding authenticity to your projects. Here's how to begin:",feature1Title:"Authentic Filipino Expression",feature1Description:"Our Filipino voice generator offers speech that’s clear and resonant with the local culture. It captures the nuances of the Filipino language and its regional accents, providing a true-to-life experience.",feature2Title:"Diverse Range of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from our extensive collection of Filipino voices, each perfect for different types of content. Our range ensures the ideal tone and style for your specific needs."},{name:"Malay",flag:"MY",language:"Malay",audioSrc:"malay",placeholderText:"Selamat datang ke Elevenlabs! Klik butang main di bawah untuk menukarkan teks ini kepada ucapan dalam bahasa Melayu. Tambah teks anda sendiri atau sesuaikan suara menggunakan menu dropdown. Daftar percuma untuk membuka ciri lanjutan seperti pengklonan suara, dubbing, dan perubahan suara.",howToDescription:"Enrich your content with our Malay text to speech. Our AI-driven Malay TTS offers a vibrant and authentic tone, perfect for bringing a local touch to your projects. Here’s how to start:",feature1Title:"Vivid Malay Speech",feature1Description:"Our Malay voice generator uses advanced AI to produce clear and culturally resonant speech. It captures the essence of the Malay language, including its regional dialects and expressions.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Library",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide array of Malay voices, each offering a unique accent and tone. Our collection ensures flexibility and quality for various content types."},{name:"Romanian",flag:"RO",language:"Romanian",audioSrc:"romanian",placeholderText:"Bun venit la Elevenlabs! Apăsați butonul de redare de mai jos pentru a converti acest text în vorbire în limba română. Adăugați textul dvs. sau personalizați vocea folosind meniul derulant. Înscrieți-vă gratuit pentru a debloca funcții avansate, cum ar fi clonarea vocii, dublajul și schimbarea vocii.",howToDescription:"Revitalize your projects with our Romanian text to speech. Our AI-powered Romanian TTS delivers an authentic and engaging accent, perfect for adding a unique European flair to your content. Start here:",feature1Title:"Dynamic Romanian Speech",feature1Description:"Leverage our AI for Romanian speech that’s clear and culturally nuanced. Our TTS captures the unique characteristics of the Romanian language, including its regional accents.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Selection",feature2Description:"Explore our variety of Romanian voices to find the perfect match for your needs. Our collection offers diverse tones and styles, suitable for a range of applications."},{name:"Ukrainian",flag:"UA",language:"Ukrainian",audioSrc:"ukrainian",voice_id:"WczBIOau2qV9z7nLeDqq",placeholderText:"Ласкаво просимо до Elevenlabs! Натисніть кнопку відтворення нижче, щоб перетворити цей текст на українську мову. Додайте свій власний текст або налаштуйте голос за допомогою випадаючого меню. Зареєструйтеся безкоштовно, щоб отримати доступ до розширених функцій, таких як клонування голосу, дублювання та зміна голосу.",howToDescription:"Enhance your content with our Ukrainian text to speech. Our AI-driven Ukrainian TTS provides a genuine and rich linguistic experience, ideal for creating engaging and culturally resonant content. Here’s how to use it:",feature1Title:"Authentic Ukrainian Dialects",feature1Description:"Our Ukrainian voice generator, powered by AI, offers speech that's clear and emotionally engaging. It captures the essence of the Ukrainian language, including its regional dialects and cultural nuances.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Options",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide range of Ukrainian voices, each with its unique accent and tone. Our collection ensures versatility and quality for various content types."},{name:"Greek",flag:"GR",language:"Greek",audioSrc:"greek",placeholderText:"Καλώς ήρθατε στο Elevenlabs! Κάντε κλικ στο κουμπί αναπαραγωγής παρακάτω για να μετατρέψετε αυτό το κείμενο σε Ελληνικά. Προσθέστε το δικό σας κείμενο ή προσαρμόστε τη φωνή χρησιμοποιώντας το αναδυόμενο μενού. Εγγραφείτε δωρεάν για να ξεκλειδώσετε προηγμένες δυνατότητες όπως η κλωνοποίηση φωνής, η δημιουργία επαναλήψεων και η αλλαγή φωνής.",howToDescription:"Bring a unique Mediterranean flair to your content with our Greek text to speech. Our AI-powered Greek TTS captures the essence of the Greek language, perfect for engaging and authentic voiceovers. Here’s how to get started:",feature1Title:"Rich Greek Linguistic Detail",feature1Description:"Our Greek voice generator is at the forefront of AI technology, offering speech that is clear, nuanced, and culturally rich. It captures the subtleties of the Greek language and its regional accents.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Range",feature2Description:"Select from a broad selection of Greek voices, each tailored to fit various needs. Our collection ensures the right tone and style for your content, enhancing its impact and appeal."},{name:"Czech",flag:"CZ",language:"Czech",audioSrc:"czech",placeholderText:"Vítejte v Elevenlabs! Klikněte na tlačítko přehrát níže a převeďte tento text na češtinu. Přidejte svůj vlastní text nebo přizpůsobte hlas pomocí rozbalovacího menu. Zaregistrujte se zdarma a získejte přístup k pokročilým funkcím, jako je klonování hlasu, dabing a změna hlasu.",howToDescription:"Transform your content with our Czech text to speech. Our AI-powered Czech TTS delivers a true Central European accent, perfect for adding an authentic and engaging touch to your projects. Here’s your starting point:",feature1Title:"Authentic Czech Speech",feature1Description:"Experience the best in AI-driven Czech speech, offering clarity and cultural depth. Our TTS captures the nuances of the Czech language and its regional dialects.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Library",feature2Description:"Our Czech TTS provides a wide selection of voices, enabling you to find the perfect match for your needs. Our library caters to a range of applications, ensuring quality and versatility."},{name:"Czech Moravian Accent",flag:"CZ",language:"Czech",audioSrc:"czech-moravian-accent",voice_id:"RLNDyOw6Pdm1OI4UkciF",placeholderText:"Vítejte v Elevenlabs! Klikněte na tlačítko přehrát níže a převeďte tento text na češtinu. Přidejte svůj vlastní text nebo přizpůsobte hlas pomocí rozbalovacího menu. Zaregistrujte se zdarma a získejte přístup k pokročilým funkcím, jako je klonování hlasu, dabing a změna hlasu.",howToDescription:"Transform your content with our Czech Moravian Accent text to speech. Our AI-powered Czech TTS delivers a true Moravian accent, perfect for adding an authentic and engaging touch to your projects. Here’s your starting point:",feature1Title:"Authentic Czech Moravian Speech",feature1Description:"Experience the best in AI-driven Czech Moravian speech, offering clarity and cultural depth. Our TTS captures the nuances of the Czech language and its regional dialects.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Library",feature2Description:"Our Czech TTS provides a wide selection of voices, enabling you to find the perfect match for your needs. Our library caters to a range of applications, ensuring quality and versatility."},{name:"Danish",flag:"DK",language:"Danish",audioSrc:"danish",voice_id:"XB0fDUnXU5powFXDhCwa",placeholderText:"Velkommen til Elevenlabs! Klik på afspilningsknappen nedenfor for at konvertere denne tekst til dansk. Tilføj din egen tekst eller tilpas stemmen ved hjælp af rullemenuen. Tilmeld dig gratis for at låse op for avancerede funktioner som stemmekloning, dubbing og stemmeskift.",howToDescription:"Elevate your projects with our Danish text to speech. Our AI-driven Danish TTS offers a unique Nordic accent, perfect for content that requires a touch of Scandinavian elegance. Here’s how to get started:",feature1Title:"Distinctive Danish Elegance",feature1Description:"Our Danish voice generator uses advanced AI to produce speech that's clear and culturally accurate. It captures the essence of the Danish language, including its regional dialects.",feature2Title:"Wide Variety of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from our extensive range of Danish voices, each offering a unique tone and accent. Our collection ensures the right voice for every type of content."},{name:"Finnish",flag:"FI",language:"Finnish",audioSrc:"finnish",voice_id:"XB0fDUnXU5powFXDhCwa",placeholderText:"Tervetuloa Elevenlabsiin! Klikkaa alla olevaa toistopainiketta muuttaaksesi tämän tekstin suomeksi. Lisää oma tekstisi tai mukauta ääntä pudotusvalikon kautta. Rekisteröidy ilmaiseksi saadaksesi käyttöösi edistyneitä ominaisuuksia, kuten äänen kloonaus, dubbaus ja äänen muuttaminen.",howToDescription:"Add a Nordic touch to your content with our Finnish text to speech. Our AI-powered Finnish TTS is perfect for creating content with a unique and engaging tone. Here’s how to use it:",feature1Title:"Authentic Finnish Nuances",feature1Description:"Our Finnish voice generator leverages AI to produce speech that’s both clear and culturally resonant. It captures the unique aspects of the Finnish language, including its regional dialects.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Options",feature2Description:"Our Finnish TTS offers a wide range of voices, ensuring you find the perfect match for your specific needs. Our library is diverse, catering to various styles and applications."},{name:"Bulgarian",flag:"BG",language:"Bulgarian",audioSrc:"bulgarian",voice_id:"WczBIOau2qV9z7nLeDqq",placeholderText:"Добре дошли в Elevenlabs! Щракнете върху бутона за възпроизвеждане по-долу, за да преобразувате този текст на български език. Добавете свой собствен текст или персонализирайте гласа чрез падащото меню. Регистрирайте се безплатно, за да отключите напреднали функции като клониране на глас, дублиране и промяна на гласа.",howToDescription:"Revitalize your content with our Bulgarian text to speech. Our AI-driven Bulgarian TTS offers an authentic Balkan accent, perfect for adding a local touch to your content. Here’s how to start:",feature1Title:"Realistic Bulgarian Speech",feature1Description:"Our Bulgarian voice generator uses advanced AI to produce speech that's clear and culturally relevant. It captures the essence of the Bulgarian language, including its regional dialects and expressions.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Library",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide array of Bulgarian voices, each offering a unique accent and tone. Our collection ensures flexibility and quality for various content types."},{name:"Croatian",flag:"HR",language:"Croatian",audioSrc:"croatian",placeholderText:"Dobrodošli u Elevenlabs! Kliknite na gumb za reprodukciju u nastavku kako biste pretvorili ovaj tekst na hrvatski jezik. Dodajte svoj vlastiti tekst ili prilagodite glas pomoću padajućeg izbornika. Prijavite se besplatno kako biste otključali napredne značajke poput kloniranja glasa, sinkronizacije i promjene glasa.",howToDescription:"Enhance your projects with our Croatian text to speech. Our AI-powered Croatian TTS delivers an authentic and engaging Mediterranean accent, perfect for adding a unique European touch to your content. Here’s how to begin:",feature1Title:"Dynamic Croatian Speech",feature1Description:"Our Croatian voice generator leverages AI for speech that’s clear and culturally nuanced. It captures the unique characteristics of the Croatian language, including its regional accents.",feature2Title:"Extensive Voice Selection",feature2Description:"Explore our variety of Croatian voices to find the perfect match for your needs. Our collection offers diverse tones and styles, suitable for a range of applications."},{name:"Slovak",flag:"SK",language:"Slovak",audioSrc:"slovak",placeholderText:"Vitajte v Elevenlabs! Kliknite na tlačidlo prehrávania nižšie, aby ste tento text preložili do slovenčiny. Pridajte svoj vlastný text alebo prispôsobte hlas pomocou rozbaľovacieho menu. Zaregistrujte sa zadarmo a odomknite pokročilé funkcie, ako je klonovanie hlasu, dabing a zmena hlasu.",howToDescription:"Enrich your content with our Slovak text to speech. Powered by advanced AI, our Slovak TTS offers an authentic and engaging voice, perfect for delivering content with a local touch. Here’s how to get started:",feature1Title:"Genuine Slovak Experience",feature1Description:"Our AI-driven Slovak voice generator is unparalleled in its ability to produce clear, emotionally resonant speech. It captures the unique subtleties and regional accents of the Slovak language, ensuring a realistic and engaging experience.",feature2Title:"Diverse Voice Library",feature2Description:"Choose from a wide variety of Slovak voices to find the one that best suits your project. Our selection includes different tones and styles, allowing you to tailor your content to your specific needs."},{name:"Tamil",flag:"IN",language:"Tamil",audioSrc:"tamil",placeholderText:"எலிவன்லேப்ஸ்க்கு வருக! இந்த உரையை தமிழுக்கு மாற்ற கீழே உள்ள பிளே பட்டனை அழுத்துங்கள். உங்கள் சொந்த உரையை சேர்க்கவும் அல்லது டிராப்டவுன் மெனுவின் மூலம் குரலை மாற்றிக் கொள்ளவும். குரல் குளோனிங், டப்பிங், மற்றும் குரல் மாற்றும் போன்ற மேம்பட்ட அம்சங்களை பெற இலவசமாக பதிவு செய்யுங்கள்.",howToDescription:"Transform your projects with our Tamil text to speech. Our AI-powered TTS brings the rich tones of Tamil to life, perfect for creating content that resonates with authenticity and cultural depth. Here’s how to begin:",feature1Title:"Authentic Tamil Delivery",feature1Description:"Leverage the latest in AI technology with our Tamil voice generator. It provides speech that is not only clear and engaging but also captures the essence of Tamil dialects and cultural nuances, offering a genuine listening experience.",feature2Title:"Variety of Tamil Voices",feature2Description:"Our diverse range of Tamil voices allows you to find the perfect match for your content. Whether you need a specific tone or style, our collection ensures that you can tailor your TTS to meet your unique requirements."},{name:"British Accent",flag:"GB",language:"English",audioSrc:"british-accent",voice_id:"onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",placeholderText:"Welcome to Elevenlabs! Click the play button below to convert this text to speech in English. Add your own text or customize the voice using the dropdown menu. Sign up for free to unlock advanced features such as voice cloning, dubbing, and voice changing.",howToDescription:"Elevate your content with our British Accent text to speech. This AI-powered tool delivers authentic British English, perfect for a range of applications. Here's how to begin:",feature1Title:"Authentic British Elegance",feature1Description:"Our British Accent TTS offers a clear, refined speech, capturing the sophistication and unique nuances of British English.",feature2Title:"Wide Variety of Voices",feature2Description:"Explore our extensive range of voices with the British Accent, each perfect for different types of content, ensuring the ideal voice for your project."},{name:"Canadian Accent",flag:"CA",language:"English",audioSrc:"canadian-accent",voice_id:"ySaYS84ykPC7FKlpD4ag",placeholderText:"Welcome to Elevenlabs! Click the play button below to convert this text to speech in English. Add your own text or customize the voice using the dropdown menu. Sign up for free to unlock advanced features such as voice cloning, dubbing, and voice changing.",howToDescription:"Elevate your content with our Canadian Accent text to speech. This AI-powered tool delivers authent