tures such as voice cloning, dubbing, and voice changing.",howToDescription:"Elevate your projects with our Irish Accent text to speech. This AI-driven tool provides a genuine Irish English experience, ideal for a range of applications. Here's how to start:",feature1Title:"Rich Irish Tone",feature1Description:"Our TTS offers a clear, engaging Irish Accent, capturing the lyrical and distinct nuances of Irish English, perfect for bringing authenticity to your content.",feature2Title:"Variety of Voices",feature2Description:"Choose from our wide selection of voices with the Irish Accent, each suitable for different content needs, ensuring a perfect match for your project."},{name:"Italian Accent",flag:"IT",language:"English",audioSrc:"italian-accent",voice_id:"zcAOhNBS3c14rBihAFp1",placeholderText:"Welcome to Elevenlabs! Click the play button below to convert this text to speech in English. Add your own text or customize the voice using the dropdown menu. Sign up for free to unlock advanced features such as voice cloning, dubbing, and voice changing.",howToDescription:"Add a unique European touch with our Italian Accent text to speech. This AI-powered tool provides a distinct Italian-tinged English, perfect for diverse content needs. Here's how to use it:",feature1Title:"Distinct Italian Inflection",feature1Description:"Our TTS captures the unique melody and intonation of Italian-influenced English, offering speech that’s clear and engaging for an authentic experience.",feature2Title:"Broad Voice Selection",feature2Description:"Select from a variety of voices with the Italian Accent, tailored for different applications, ensuring the right tone and style for your content."},{name:"Essex Accent",flag:"GB",language:"English",audioSrc:"essex-accent",voice_id:"CYw3kZ02Hs0563khs1Fj",placeholderText:"Welcome to Elevenlabs! Click the play button below to convert this text to speech in English. Add your own text or customize the voice using the dropdown menu. Sign up for free to